=== Step 4: Creating Indexes ===
  idx_category_price_rating    keys={'category': 1, 'price': 1, 'rating': 1}  -> Q1 (prefix), Q5 (ESR)
  idx_price                    keys={'price': 1}  -> Q2
  idx_tags                     keys={'tags': 1}  -> Q3 (multikey)
  idx_name_text                keys={'name': 'text'}  -> Q4
[OK] Created 4 indexes.

=== Step 4: EXPLAIN with indexes ===
  Q1 Electronics, cheapest 20 first
    Stage: LIMIT > FETCH > IXSCAN
    Index: idx_category_price_rating
    totalDocsExamined: 20  totalKeysExamined: 20  nReturned: 20  time: 13 ms
  Q2 Price between $100 and $150
    Stage: FETCH > IXSCAN
    Index: idx_price
    totalDocsExamined: 2,532  totalKeysExamined: 2,532  nReturned: 2,532  time: 7 ms
  Q3 Tagged 'wireless'
    Stage: FETCH > IXSCAN
    Index: idx_tags
    totalDocsExamined: 10,459  totalKeysExamined: 10,459  nReturned: 10,459  time: 21 ms
  Q4 Text search name: 'headphones'
    Stage: TEXT_MATCH > FETCH > IXSCAN
    Index: idx_name_text
    totalDocsExamined: 1,236  totalKeysExamined: 1,236  nReturned: 1,236  time: 4 ms
  Q5 Books rated >= 4.5, by price
    Stage: FETCH > IXSCAN
    Index: idx_category_price_rating
    totalDocsExamined: 880  totalKeysExamined: 6,148  nReturned: 880  time: 17 ms

